    <tr><td><code>styles</code></td><td><code>StylesProp | undefined</code></td><td>-</td><td>Spectrum-defined styles returned by the style macro.</td></tr>
    <tr><td><code>type</code></td><td><code>"button" | "reset" | "submit" | undefined</code></td><td><code>button</code></td><td>Behavior when used inside a form.</td></tr>
